    "body": "@markusicu @macchiati could you provide some context for these changes? While we submitted a bunch of feedback (as recorded in #744) it seems there's quite a few other changes as well.\r\n\r\nE.g., `Ⅎ` is an invalid domain name today, but with Unicode 16 would be valid?\r\n\r\n(We are seeing this in WebKit as well now: https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/37104.)",
